{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/conj-topological-charge-quantization","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Conjecture","doco:Section"],"label":"conj:topological-charge-quantization","kind":"conjecture","title":"Quantization of topological charge","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-unit-particle-state","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-rigid-dualizing-complex"],"cites":["references/yekutieli2015"],"tags":["topological-charge","residue","quantization","algebraic-residue"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.topological_charge_quantization","text":"topological-charge-quantization.md","leanSource":"topological-charge-quantization.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"conj:topological-charge-quantization\"></a><p>The topological charge of the unit particle is quantized. The algebraic residue at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">z = 1</code>, computed via the observer trace <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi</code>, equals unity:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathrm{Res}_q(\\omega, 1) = \\Phi\\bigl(\\mathrm{Res}_{\\xi}(\\omega)\\bigr) = 1</code></pre>\n<p>This quantization serves as the algebraic counterpart of the Gauss--Bonnet theorem, following from the non-degeneracy of the Frobenius pairing and the periodicity of the Reeb derivation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\xi_q</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/topological-charge-quantization.md","heading":"Conjecture","number":"8.13.9","page":"b/conj-topological-charge-quantization","qa":{"counts":{"pass":90,"fail":1,"warn":1,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":78},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.Core.AlgebraicSubstrate.topological_charge_quantization","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/topological-charge-quantization.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
